<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"tf-cell__h"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading tf-cell__h">Fridays for Mrs. Duval</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tf-cell__txt"} -->
<p class="tf-cell__txt">Every Friday morning for several years, Lin Wei has delivered a paper-wrapped bundle of conditioned stems to Mrs. Duval's front door on the harbour side of Aldmere. As part of our weekly household subscription at €36 per delivery, Mrs. Duval places the flowers in a ceramic jug in her entrance hallway. From early winter hellebores to summer sweet peas, this steady ritual marks the arrival of the weekend, proving that regular seasonal flowers can become an essential and reassuring rhythm in domestic life.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tf-tags tf-tags--l"} -->
<p class="tf-tags tf-tags--l">#subscription #fridays</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"tf-cell tf-cell--text","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tf-cell tf-cell--text"><!-- wp:group {"className":"tf-cell__photo tf-cell__photo--l","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tf-cell__photo tf-cell__photo--l"><!-- wp:image {"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none","className":"sp-reveal sp-reveal--mask"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full sp-reveal sp-reveal--mask"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/images/i7-buttonholes.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="Six buttonholes laid out in a row on a wooden tray"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"tf-cell__h"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading tf-cell__h">A Garden Wedding for Thirty</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tf-cell__txt"} -->
<p class="tf-cell__txt">An outdoor wedding celebration for thirty close friends and family required an understated, natural approach. Working within our small ceremony package from €420, Aiyana Brooks created low stoneware table vessels filled with garden foliage, pale blossoms, and herbs, alongside six tailored buttonholes. The arrangements sat effortlessly along a single long refectory table under apple trees, withstanding the afternoon breeze and reflecting the unhurried warmth of a family celebrating in their own private garden.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tf-tags tf-tags--l"} -->
<p class="tf-tags tf-tags--l">#wedding #garden</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"tf-cell tf-cell--text","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
