<div class="wp-block-group tf-cell__photo tf-cell__photo--l"><!-- wp:image {"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none","className":"sp-reveal sp-reveal--mask"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full sp-reveal sp-reveal--mask"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/images/h6-sympathy-wreath.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="A sympathy arrangement in white and green, a simple foliage wreath on linen"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"tf-cell__h"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading tf-cell__h">Goodbye with Sweet Peas</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tf-cell__txt"} -->
<p class="tf-cell__txt">When a local family came to 14 Linden Row to plan a memorial for a passionate gardener, they asked for arrangements that reflected her love of fragrant borders. Mara Ellison and Noor Haddad composed a sympathy tribute starting from €120 featuring pale sweet peas, garden greens, and trailing ivy laid across natural linen. The subtle fragrance and honest simplicity of the stems offered comfort without ostentation, providing a gentle and personal farewell that truly honoured a life spent tending the earth.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tf-tags tf-tags--l"} -->
<p class="tf-tags tf-tags--l">#memorial #sweetpeas</p>
